#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:3
#: 748b54ffe7c54a05b7d888ddc2359c81
msgid "晶体原型构建（Crystal Prototype Builder）"
msgstr "Crystal Prototype Builder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:5
#: e21b411964e8424cabdaa7ed3d118376
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:7
#: 248c849ec3d34aa5bb15aa36c81f048c
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:9
#: 42ae7e910fbc436eac015b5c9041a129
msgid ""
"无需输入结构，直接生成单元素的 FCC、BCC、HCP 或 FCC (111) "
"定向**基础晶胞**。它适合补充训练集中缺失的标准晶型，或作为后续扩胞、应变、缺陷和层错流程的干净起点。"
msgstr ""
"Generate a single-element FCC, BCC, HCP, or FCC (111)-oriented **base cell** without "
"an input structure. Use it to add missing standard crystal phases to a training set "
"or to create a clean starting point for later expansion, strain, defect, and "
"stacking-fault workflows."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:11
#: 58977031562841c7937f6cc2051b54b8
msgid "输出是由原型和晶格参数确定的基础晶胞。需要更大的结构时，在后面连接 [扩胞（Super Cell）](super-cell-card.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The output is a base cell determined by the selected prototype and lattice "
"parameters. To create a larger structure, connect [Super Cell](super-cell-card.md) "
"after this card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:13
#: 83dcff31c3384d2f8dd1230777080593
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:15
#: dae1eaa337f24795b59282f81602abeb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "每种原型由晶胞矩阵 $\\mathbf C_0(a,c/a)$ 和分数坐标集合 $\\{\\mathbf s_j\\}$ 定义。卡片按所选晶格常数直接构造："
msgstr ""
"Each prototype is defined by a cell matrix $\\mathbf C_0(a,c/a)$ and a set of "
"fractional coordinates $\\{\\mathbf s_j\\}$. The card constructs the structure "
"directly from the selected lattice constant:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:17
#: c98c7b729b134053b40da89069f9ffa2
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf r_j=\\mathbf s_j\\mathbf C_0.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:21
#: d791b9e0aaa547eeab2d7af1c6aef83a
msgid "输出均为理想、未弛豫、三维周期结构："
msgstr "Every output is an ideal, unrelaxed, three-dimensionally periodic structure:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: c262a8b879994eeca23d5d90f4cdb273
msgid "原型"
msgstr "Prototype"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: a1e409fdff824f2db6e3efeaf08ab77b
msgid "基础晶胞"
msgstr "Base cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 5d5562f95c714185988760620e2dd3ba
msgid "原子数"
msgstr "Atom count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 793ee320eede4138a4805b88334993f4
msgid "FCC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 299b6b71ec5e451db815422d9ae37c9d 61476717eb22425d9a85606d941dadf8
msgid "常规立方晶胞"
msgstr "Conventional cubic cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 7c2aec4390f64f00943cf7e3304165a4
msgid "4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 137d4f8a38a74e0d922067003f4cd379
msgid "BCC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 8b4798f6a96048eb926dd40833af47d9 c74d897d5dca4425b7cfba4827aae6a4
msgid "2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: eb86784f73e14cf39e92e6f538ef68c3
msgid "HCP"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 121a397e50af4b9b83ac991dc2cddd57
msgid "六方原胞，$c=a(c/a)$"
msgstr "Hexagonal primitive cell, $c=a(c/a)$"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 1bd709f90e074cce99ee1431de4bd7da
msgid "FCC (111)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 32463ae4975c47c3b0d07fc81f08bd28
msgid "(111) 法向沿第三晶格向量的定向周期晶胞"
msgstr "Oriented periodic cell with the (111) normal along the third lattice vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 33b713dc402b4696a3d1aa897a10b29f
msgid "6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:30
#: fb240a412b844999a62888006bf1afb9
msgid "`fcc111` 保持 `PBC = (True, True, True)`，没有真空层，因此不是表面 slab。"
msgstr ""
"`fcc111` retains `PBC = (True, True, True)` and contains no vacuum, so it is not a "
"surface slab."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:32
#: 2416454693a3404ca352eab92168c54d
msgid "晶格常数扫描"
msgstr "Lattice-Constant Scan"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:34
#: 03169b08dcc743eead7fda8754873690
msgid "`a_range = (a_min, a_max, step)` 按正步长取样；反向端点会先交换，恰好达到的终点会包含在内。"
msgstr ""
"`a_range = (a_min, a_max, step)` samples with a positive step. Reversed endpoints are"
" swapped first, and the upper endpoint is included when the step reaches it exactly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:36
#: 8eb7e240695e46a1bfbcbf5a1ec92c5d
msgid "若完整扫描有 $M$ 个点，实际输出数为"
msgstr "If the full scan contains $M$ points, the actual number of outputs is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:38
#: fda8e9f4af43412f882f938ae69b5761
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=\\min(M,N_{\\max\\_outputs}).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:42
#: ef6c0415015b40188f43b41c4800ad2d
msgid "发生截断时，只保留从较小 $a$ 开始的前几个点，界面会同时显示完整点数和实际输出数。"
msgstr ""
"When the scan is truncated, only the first points starting from the smaller $a$ are "
"retained. The interface shows both the full point count and the actual output count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:44
#: ff73ea6ddcc64fd491c8c14ae7c6981d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:46
#: 4eb346a6d7cf4c7f9976a39a99b5f8df
msgid "补充 BCC Fe 的晶格参考构型"
msgstr "Add BCC Fe Lattice Reference Structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:48
#: 4548132f531942349b22c07361aaca54
msgid "若模型在 BCC Fe 平衡态附近仍有明显能量或应力误差："
msgstr "If a model still has substantial energy or stress errors near equilibrium BCC Fe:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:50
#: 2056a0e17e534c8ebff74b2f2c58ba26
msgid "原型选择 `BCC 常规晶胞`，元素填写 `Fe`；"
msgstr "Choose `BCC conventional cell` and enter `Fe` as the element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:51
#: 2288d57b085e4bd18cdd8c51bdf2f0d2
msgid "将 `a` 扫描设为 `2.80, 2.92, 0.03 Å`；"
msgstr "Set the `a` scan to `2.80, 2.92, 0.03 Å`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:52
#: 9ef69e5f36a44befb00c42bc53a818f7
msgid "预览应显示 5 个基础晶胞，每个含 2 个原子；"
msgstr "The preview should show five base cells with two atoms each."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:53
#: 697fae44027e41aa918e14570030abf6
msgid "若 DFT 或后续操作需要更大晶胞，连接“扩胞”卡，再选择重复倍率、目标长度或原子预算。"
msgstr ""
"If DFT or a downstream operation requires a larger cell, connect `Super Cell` and "
"then choose repeat factors, target lengths, or an atom budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:55
#: 3aef15b1b215412c8234088e25be7bc9
msgid "完成 DFT 标注和重训后，应比较同一 $a$ 网格上的能量—体积曲线和应力，而不只看总 RMSE。"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, compare energy-volume curves and stresses on the "
"same $a$ grid instead of relying only on aggregate RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:57
#: 7a8e76acab1a415f85c9a6cb8e3a924d
msgid "生成 FCC (111) 层错起点"
msgstr "Create an FCC (111) Starting Cell for Stacking Faults"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:59
#: aae98188fe82475f84a8603d350fb112
msgid ""
"选择 `FCC (111) 定向周期晶胞`，输入与材料匹配的 FCC 常规晶格常数。随后先用“扩胞”卡设置所需面内尺寸，再连接 "
"GSFE/层错卡。该原型自身始终三维周期、无真空。"
msgstr ""
"Choose `FCC (111)-oriented periodic cell` and enter a conventional FCC lattice "
"constant appropriate for the material. Then use `Super Cell` to set the required in-"
"plane size before connecting a GSFE or stacking-fault card. The prototype itself is "
"always three-dimensionally periodic and contains no vacuum."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:62
#: 12deff65b9434381bb9fcd17224b7f20
msgid "不同晶型的 `a` 定义不同。HCP 的基面晶格常数不能直接照搬 FCC 常规立方晶格常数；比较相稳定性时，应分别使用物理合理的参数范围。"
msgstr ""
"The meaning of `a` differs between crystal prototypes. The basal-plane lattice "
"constant of HCP cannot be copied directly from the conventional cubic FCC lattice "
"constant. Use physically reasonable parameter ranges for each phase when comparing "
"phase stability."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:65
#: 92bd0a3ba8034e3f8398789cd49950cb
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:67
#: 6ef3d52784b8411fbcba3483f03de3f2
msgid "晶体原型（lattice）"
msgstr "Crystal Prototype (lattice)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:69
#: d6347c140875440c923780675bc2b21c
msgid "`str`，默认 `fcc`。可选 `fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp`、`fcc111`；其基础晶胞和原子数见上表。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `fcc`. Available values are `fcc`, `bcc`, `hcp`, and `fcc111`; their "
"base cells and atom counts are listed above."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:71
#: dee68d19980e4aaba1ae3ef622c25737
msgid "元素（element）"
msgstr "element"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:73
#: 2e6ad66cd430482ba4c4ae6e14d749ae
msgid "`str`，默认 `Cu`。只接受一个真实元素符号，如 `Cu`、`Fe`、`Mg`。空值、化学式和虚元素 `X` 都会失败。多元素占位应交给后续成分/占位卡。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Cu`. Accepts exactly one real element symbol, such as `Cu`, `Fe`, or "
"`Mg`. An empty value, a chemical formula, or the dummy element `X` is rejected. Use a"
" downstream composition or occupancy card for multielement structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:75
#: f7b5a4ff3f214026b877432a2006fc14
msgid "晶格常数范围（a_range）"
msgstr "Lattice-Constant Range (a_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:77
#: 29c2b33fefc54fac82486d0db3fee2bb
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(3.6, 3.6, 0.1)`，单位 "
"Å，依次为最小值、最大值、正步长。所有值必须有限，晶格常数和步长必须大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(3.6, 3.6, 0.1)` in Å. The values are the "
"minimum, maximum, and positive step, in that order. Every value must be finite, and "
"both lattice constants and the step must be greater than zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:79
#: f00d98fbdf534017894a0b3af9c94d4f
msgid "HCP 轴比（covera）"
msgstr "HCP Axial Ratio (covera)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:81
#: f4e4d70255a149048161ad5a687b7f85
msgid "`float`，默认 `1.633`。仅 `hcp` 显示并生效，定义 $c/a$，必须为有限正数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `1.633`. Shown and used only for `hcp`; defines $c/a$ and must be "
"finite and positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:83
#: d4c217cd175540a1901b5efe5be5396d
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:85
#: 48aed8cd9bea440380317b7e607b790d
msgid "`int`，默认 `200`，至少为 1。它只截断当前卡片的 `a` 扫描，被截断的较大 $a$ 点不会输出。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `200`, minimum 1. It truncates only this card's `a` scan; larger $a$ "
"points beyond the limit are not generated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:87
#: 1cac0bf9d71b4671931f2442267c0f83
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:89
#: a675dcc10a564c518204fabe57f820ab
msgid "**在哪里设置原子数或重复倍率？** 在这张卡后连接“扩胞”卡。原型卡输出基础晶胞，扩胞卡统一负责重复倍率、目标长度和原子预算。"
msgstr ""
"**Where do I set the atom count or repeat factors?** Connect `Super Cell` after this "
"card. The prototype card outputs a base cell, while `Super Cell` handles repeat "
"factors, target lengths, and atom budgets."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:91
#: 3c68508f4adb475b9a2e0454cc3edf16
msgid "**为什么旧配置生成的结构变小了？** 旧版内置的扩胞参数已经移除。加载含这些字段的配置时，程序会明确提示参数已忽略；请补上一张“扩胞”卡恢复所需尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does an old configuration now generate a smaller structure?** The legacy built-"
"in expansion parameters were removed. When a configuration containing those fields is"
" loaded, the application explicitly reports that they were ignored. Add a `Super "
"Cell` card to restore the required size."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:93
#: 308aaa1db59e42a5901630529966095e
msgid "**FCC (111) 输出为什么没有真空？** 该选项是供层错等周期流程使用的定向周期晶胞。真正的表面结构应交给表面/slab 卡生成。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the FCC (111) output contain no vacuum?** This option creates an oriented "
"periodic cell for stacking-fault and other periodic workflows. Use a surface or slab "
"card to create an actual free surface."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:95
#: 1c5cfa692b4a46e3b2af8afcb01b0f9c
msgid "输出合同"
msgstr "Output Contract"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:97
#: c9268d46956a437eaf22b2e72c1639d5
msgid "每个 $a$ 采样点输出一个所选元素的理想基础晶胞。"
msgstr "Each sampled $a$ value produces one ideal base cell of the selected element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:98
#: cc0dea4f06ce4dc5ac30061715073842
#, python-brace-format
msgid "标签为 `Proto({lattice},a={a})`。"
msgstr "The label is `Proto({lattice},a={a})`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:99
#: 47f2e31873cd4f5488240da25e100474
msgid "无随机性，相同参数产生相同结构。"
msgstr "There is no randomness; identical parameters produce identical structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:104
#: 3f377dcd120841c4967e17b474ef0615
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"bcc\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [2.80, 2.92, 0.03],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 5\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "再开一张同参数但 `lattice = \"hcp\"` 的卡"
#~ msgstr "Add a second card with the same parameters but set `lattice = \"hcp\"`."

#~ msgid "如果输出原子数远小于 `max_atoms`，说明 auto_supercell 找不到合适的扩胞因子——关掉 `auto_supercell`，手动设 `Rep`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the output contains far fewer atoms "
#~ "than `max_atoms`, automatic supercell selection "
#~ "could not find a suitable repetition. Disable"
#~ " `auto_supercell` and set `Rep` manually."

#~ msgid "接 `Strict GSFE Path`，扫 fcc (111) 面内滑移"
#~ msgstr "Use before `Strict GSFE Path` to scan in-plane slip on fcc (111)."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`fcc111` 不是带真空的表面 slab；它仍然是周期 cell，只是把原始 fcc 的 "
#~ "(111) 面转成当前 cell 的 `(001)` 面。这样 `Strict "
#~ "GSFE Path` 可以安全地按第三晶胞方向切开上下两半。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`fcc111` is not a surface slab with "
#~ "vacuum. It remains a periodic cell, but "
#~ "the original fcc (111) plane is reoriented "
#~ "to the current cell's `(001)` plane. This "
#~ "lets `Strict GSFE Path` safely divide the "
#~ "structure into upper and lower halves along"
#~ " the third cell direction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'Cu'`。元素符号，如 `Cu`、`Ni`、`Si`。对于化合物原型（如 "
#~ "rocksalt），这里只用第一个元素——后续需要用 `Composition Sweep` + `Random"
#~ " Occupancy` 来实现多元素分布。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `'Cu'`. Element symbol, such "
#~ "as `Cu`, `Ni`, or `Si`. For compound "
#~ "prototypes such as rocksalt, this card uses"
#~ " only the first element. Use `Composition "
#~ "Sweep` followed by `Random Occupancy` to "
#~ "introduce multiple elements."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(3.6, 3.6, "
#~ "0.1)`。晶格常数 a 的扫描范围，格式 `[最小值, 最大值, 步长]`，单位 "
#~ "Å。单点扫描如 `[3.52, 3.52, 0.1]` 产 1 个结构；区间扫描如 "
#~ "`[3.50, 3.60, 0.02]` 产 6 个。步长越小结构越多，记得用 "
#~ "`max_outputs` 控制总量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(3.6, 3.6,"
#~ " 0.1)`. Scan range for lattice constant "
#~ "*a*, in Å, expressed as `[minimum, maximum,"
#~ " step]`. A single-point range such as "
#~ "`[3.52, 3.52, 0.1]` produces one structure; "
#~ "`[3.50, 3.60, 0.02]` produces six. Smaller "
#~ "steps produce more structures, so use "
#~ "`max_outputs` to cap the total."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 true。勾选后程序自动计算扩胞因子以逼近 `Max Atoms`；不勾选则手动通过 `Rep` 指定扩胞倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. When enabled, the "
#~ "card chooses repetition factors that approach "
